>
> We will meet as usual, tomorrow from 10am-12pm in Shields Library Rm 360. If you want adventurous directions, see the treasure map on our website <http://d-rug.github.io/>. If not, just go up to the third floor on the south side of the building and Room 360 is right next to the Elevators in the DSI space.
>
> Tomorrow I'll will try to give a brief presentation (10 min) on the recent sf package <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/sf/vignettes/sf1.html> in R. If you use spatial data at all, I would highly recommend checking it out.
